# Everything under data/ is committed on purpose: the JSON, the SQLite build and
# the per-level split are the point of the project, and a consumer should be able
# to fetch one file instead of installing Python and re-scraping. Regenerate with:
#   mineduc-scraper export-sqlite    -f data/mineduc_curriculum_full.json -o data/mineduc_curriculum.db
#   mineduc-scraper split            -f data/mineduc_curriculum_full.json -o data/by_level
#   mineduc-scraper export-manifest  -f data/mineduc_curriculum_full.json -o data/manifest.json

# The Programa de Estudio PDFs live in .cache/pdfs (covered by .cache/ above).
# They are inputs, not outputs: ~820 MB, re-downloadable from curriculumnacional.cl
# and rebuilt by --pdf-cache. They were briefly committed under docs/pdfs and have
# been purged from history; keep them out.
docs/pdfs/
